<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>${register ? 'Join' : 'Sign in'} · PatentPulse</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/style.css"></head><body class="auth-body"><main class="auth-layout"><section class="auth-story"><a class="brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><span class="brand-icon">P<span>·</span></span><span>PatentPulse<small>RESEARCH INTEGRITY LEDGER</small></span></a><div class="story-content"><div class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST THOUGHT TO FINAL DRAFT</div><h1>Every idea<br>has an <em>origin.</em></h1><p>Give your research a traceable history.<br>Record, verify, and review your work in one private workspace.</p><div class="orbit-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit-core">P<span>·</span></div><span class="orbit-label one">SHA-256</span><span class="orbit-label two">VERSION 01</span><span class="orbit-label three">INTEGRITY</span></div><div class="story-features"><span>01 <strong>Record</strong></span><span>02 <strong>Verify</strong></span><span>03 <strong>Review</strong></span></div></div><small>Cryptographic fingerprints. Human review. Clear records.</small></section><section class="auth-form-side"><div class="auth-form"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH WORKSPACE</div><h2>${register ? 'Start your ledger.' : 'Welcome back.'}</h2><p class="muted">${register ? 'Create a researcher account to document your next idea.' : 'Sign in to continue building your research record.'}</p>
<c:if test="${not empty error}"><div class="alert error" role="alert"><c:out value="${error}"/></div></c:if><c:if test="${param.registered == '1'}"><div class="alert success">Account created. You can now sign in.</div></c:if>
<form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/${register ? 'register' : 'login'}"><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %>
<c:if test="${register}"><label for="name">Full name</label><input id="name" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name"></c:if>
<label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@university.edu">
<label for="password">Password</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" required minlength="${register ? 10 : 1}" autocomplete="${register ? 'new-password' : 'current-password'}" placeholder="${register ? 'At least 10 characters' : 'Enter your password'}">
<button class="btn primary full" type="submit">${register ? 'Create researcher account' : 'Sign in to workspace'} <span>→</span></button></form>
<p class="auth-switch">${register ? 'Already have an account?' : 'New to PatentPulse?'} <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/${register ? 'login' : 'register'}">${register ? 'Sign in' : 'Create an account'}</a></p>
<c:if test="${applicationScope.demoMode}"><div class="demo-credentials"><strong>Explore the local demo</strong><p>researcher@demo.local<br>reviewer1@demo.local · reviewer2@demo.local<br>admin@demo.local</p><span>All passwords: <code>PatentPulse!2026</code></span></div></c:if>
<p class="legal-note">PatentPulse records file integrity and internal submission history. It does not establish IP ownership or grant patent rights.</p></div></section></main></body></html>
